<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Hewlett-Packard raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Hewlett-Packard raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley raised its recommendation on Hewlett-Packard Co to outperform from neutral, according to a market source.</p>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley also raised the Hewlett-Packard 1997 earnings estimate to $3.15 per share from $3.00, and established a 1998 earnings view of $3.65.</p>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley set a 12-month price target of $65 per share for the stock, the source said.</p>
</text>
